        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pipeline, natural gas, high pressure distribution network</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pipeline, natural gas, high pressure distribution network
Pipeline infrastructure for gas distribution. Life time 40 years. Annual transport of 30 TJ/km/a.;
UUID: f6d354f1-3cee-3a1f-988d-f6016a7188fe
This dataset describes the infrastructure needed for the Swiss high (&gt;1 bar) and middle (&gt;0.1 bar) pressure distribution network.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The length of the pipelines is based on statistics, whereas the thickness of the pipeline is estimated.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 3900km
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f6d354f1-3cee-3a1f-988d-f6016a7188fe.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
